00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:19.000
We finally found the gravity, we're ready to move!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.500
Touchdown!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:37.000
[Guitar & Synthesizer Duet Solo]

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.000
I thought I lost the wheels in the middle of the crash.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.800
But we built a sanctuary right out of the ash!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.400
No more floating in the freezing unknown!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.200
